Third-party learning data
-------------------------
None yet.

Every imported dataset is listed here with its source, licence, required
attribution, and the repository path that holds it, before it is merged.
The same attributions are shown to learners on the site's licences page.
Process: docs/content/README.md. Register: docs/content/sources.md.

Third-party software
--------------------
The application is built with open-source packages listed in package.json and
pinned in pnpm-lock.yaml; each is distributed under its own licence.
Publishing the licence notices of packages bundled into the production build
is a roadmap item (see ROADMAP.md, milestone 0.2).
